#### Description

Verified with [dockhand](https://github.com/herbygillot/dockhand):
  — libwidget on Sequoia: built from source in a pristine VM.
  — gdal on Sequoia: built from source in a pristine VM.
  — grass on Sequoia: built from source in a pristine VM.

ABI changed: install name /opt/local/lib/libwidget.2.dylib → /opt/local/lib/libwidget.3.dylib; libwidget compatibility_version 2.0.0 → 3.0.0 (narrowed), measured between libwidget@2.4.1 (binary archive) and @3.0 (built from source) on Testos.
this criterion is necessary and not sufficient: an install name and a compatibility version can sit still while symbols are removed, and a break confined to a header or to a plugin's own contract is invisible to otool.

2 dependents need a revision bump (gdal, grass) was proposed and dismissed by hand.

Examined and not bumped:
  — cmake (devel/cmake): depends_build only: it links nothing this change publishes

